{
  "$schema": "./recipe-schema.json",
  "meta": {
    "schemaVersion": "3.1.0",
    "component": "select",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "status": "stable",
    "tags": [
      "interactive",
      "form",
      "selection"
    ],
    "links": {
      "figma": "",
      "storybook": "",
      "docs": "/docs/select-docs"
    },
    "changelog": [
      {
        "version": "2.0.0",
        "changes": [
          "A: Optgroup-Styling via nc-select-optgroup-font-weight und nc-select-optgroup-padding-left Tokens",
          "B: Multiple-Select Guidance — natives multiple nur als Fallback, Empfehlung fuer Checkbox-Liste/Combobox",
          "C: Open-State (.is-open am Wrapper) fuer Chevron-Rotation via JS-Hook + focus-within",
          "D: Placeholder-Color-Hack via :required:invalid fuer dezente Farbe bei leerer Auswahl"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "layer": "atom",
    "pipeline": {
      "scss": [
        "scss/scss/05-atoms/_select.scss"
      ],
      "story": "stories/atoms/select.stories.js",
      "arena": "apps/theme-configurator/src/components/laboratory/RecipeArena.vue",
      "drupal": [],
      "docs": "docs/select-docs.html"
    }
  },
  "anatomy": {
    "root": {
      "element": ".nc-select"
    },
    "slots": [
      {
        "name": "indicator",
        "element": ".nc-select__indicator",
        "optional": true
      }
    ],
    "convenience": [
      {
        "name": "wrapper",
        "element": ".nc-select-wrapper",
        "optional": true,
        "description": "Positionierungs-Container fuer custom Indicator (position: relative). Pflicht fuer Chevron-Rotation (.is-open). Wenn vorhanden, wird background-image auf Select entfernt."
      }
    ],
    "domNotes": [
      "Select ist ein natives <select class='nc-select'>. Kein JS fuer Basis-Funktion noetig.",
      "Custom Arrow via background-image (SVG Chevron Down) oder via __indicator im Wrapper.",
      "Nutzt --nc-input-* Tokens als Basis (gleiche form-control Mixins wie Input).",
      "Eigene --nc-select-* Tokens fuer Indicator, Extra-Padding und Optgroup-Styling.",
      "Optgroup: <optgroup label='...'> wird via nc-select-optgroup-font-weight (semibold) und nc-select-optgroup-padding-left hervorgehoben. Options innerhalb der Gruppe werden zusaetzlich eingerueckt.",
      "Multi-Select: .nc-select--multiple oder [multiple]. Kein Arrow, height: auto. ACHTUNG: Natives multiple-Select ist schwer bedienbar (Ctrl+Click). Fuer komplexe UIs wird eine Multi-Select-Combobox-Komponente (JS-basiert) mit Tag-Cloud oder Checkbox-Liste empfohlen.",
      "Open-State: .is-open am Wrapper setzt Chevron transform: rotate(180deg). Benoetigt kleinen JS-Hook (focus/blur oder mousedown). CSS allein reicht nicht, da native Selects keinen :open Pseudo-Klassen-Support haben.",
      "Placeholder-Color-Hack: select:required:invalid { color: var(--nc-input-placeholder-color) } — funktioniert wenn Select required ist und leere Option <option value='' disabled selected> gewaehlt ist. Sobald eine valide Option gewaehlt wird, greift die normale Textfarbe.",
      "::-ms-expand wird versteckt (IE11 Arrow entfernen).",
      "Error via .nc-select--error ODER [aria-invalid='true']."
    ]
  },
  "axes": {
    "variant": {
      "label": "Variant",
      "description": "Visuelle Variante — outlined (Standard, Rahmen), filled (Flaeche mit Unterstreichung), borderless (minimalistisch)",
      "values": {
        "outlined": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "core-colors"
          ],
          "description": "Standard-Stil mit Rahmen auf allen 4 Seiten."
        },
        "filled": {
          "modifier": "nc-select--filled",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "core-colors-filled"
          ],
          "description": "Hintergrund-Flaeche mit Unterstreichung (border-bottom only). Custom Indicator statt background-image."
        },
        "borderless": {
          "modifier": "nc-select--borderless",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "core-colors-minimal"
          ],
          "description": "Minimalistischer Stil ohne sichtbaren Rahmen."
        }
      }
    },
    "size": {
      "label": "Size",
      "description": "3 Groessenabstufungen — sm (32px) / md (40px, Standard) / lg (48px). Nutzt Input-Size-Tokens.",
      "values": {
        "sm": {
          "modifier": "nc-select--sm",
          "tokenGroups": []
        },
        "md": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": []
        },
        "lg": {
          "modifier": "nc-select--lg",
          "tokenGroups": []
        }
      }
    },
    "type": {
      "label": "Type",
      "description": "Auswahl-Typ — single (Standard-Dropdown), multiple (native Mehrfachauswahl, nur Fallback)",
      "values": {
        "single": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "elementHint": "select",
          "renderHint": "select-single"
        },
        "multiple": {
          "modifier": "nc-select--multiple",
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "elementHint": "select",
          "renderHint": "select-multiple"
        }
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "label": "Content",
      "description": "Inhaltsvarianten — flat (flache Options-Liste), grouped (mit Optgroups)",
      "values": {
        "flat": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "select-flat"
        },
        "grouped": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "optgroup-styling"
          ],
          "renderHint": "select-grouped"
        }
      }
    },
    "validation": {
      "label": "Validation",
      "description": "Validierungszustand — none (Standard), error (roter Rand), success (gruener Rand)",
      "values": {
        "none": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": []
        },
        "error": {
          "modifier": "nc-select--error",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "state-error"
          ]
        },
        "success": {
          "modifier": "nc-select--success",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "state-success"
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "states": {
    "supported": [
      "default",
      "hover",
      "focus",
      "disabled",
      "open",
      "placeholder"
    ],
    "precedence": [
      "disabled",
      "focus",
      "hover",
      "default"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "state": "hover",
        "unless": [
          "disabled",
          "focus"
        ],
        "note": "Hover nur wenn nicht disabled oder fokussiert"
      },
      {
        "state": "focus",
        "unless": [
          "disabled"
        ],
        "note": "Focus nur wenn nicht disabled"
      },
      {
        "state": "open",
        "css": ".is-open",
        "note": "Wrapper-Klasse .is-open — via JS-Hook (focus/blur oder mousedown). Dreht Chevron via transform: rotate(180deg). Kein nativer CSS-Pseudo-Selektor verfuegbar."
      },
      {
        "state": "placeholder",
        "css": ":required:invalid",
        "note": "Placeholder-State: Leere Option gewaehlt (value=''), Select ist required. Zeigt dezente Farbe via --nc-input-placeholder-color. Kein :placeholder-shown verfuegbar."
      }
    ],
    "interactive": true
  },
  "a11y": {
    "base": {
      "interactive": true,
      "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
      "assertions": [
        "hasAccessibleName",
        "supportsKeyboard"
      ],
      "note": "Natives <select> — inhaerent accessible. Braucht zugehoeriges <label> (via for/id) oder aria-label. Arrow-Keys navigieren Optionen."
    },
    "overrides": [
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "validation": [
              "error"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-invalid",
          "aria-describedby"
        ],
        "note": "Error-State braucht aria-invalid='true' und aria-describedby auf Fehlermeldung."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "states": [
            "disabled"
          ]
        },
        "suggest": [
          "aria-disabled"
        ],
        "note": "aria-disabled='true' bevorzugt wenn Select Teil eines sichtbaren Formulars ist."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "type": [
              "multiple"
            ]
          }
        },
        "suggest": [
          "aria-multiselectable"
        ],
        "note": "Multiple-Select hat implizit aria-multiselectable. Ctrl+Click fuer Mehrfachauswahl ist schwer discoverable — fuer komplexe UIs eine JS-basierte Multi-Select-Combobox mit role='listbox' und aria-multiselectable='true' nutzen."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "content": [
              "grouped"
            ]
          }
        },
        "suggest": [],
        "note": "Optgroups nutzen natives <optgroup label='...'>. Die label-Attribute werden von Screenreadern automatisch vorgelesen. Keine zusaetzliche ARIA-Annotation noetig."
      }
    ]
  },
  "constraints": {
    "rules": [
      {
        "when": {},
        "require": [
          "accessible-name"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Select braucht immer <label for='...'> oder aria-label."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "validation": [
              "error"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-invalid",
          "aria-describedby"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Error braucht aria-invalid='true' + Verweis auf Fehlermeldung."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "type": [
              "multiple"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [],
        "notes": [
          "Natives multiple-Select nur als Fallback verwenden.",
          "Fuer produktive UIs: Multi-Select-Combobox (JS) mit Tag-Cloud oder Checkbox-Liste empfohlen.",
          "Grund: Ctrl+Click ist fuer Endnutzer schwer discoverable und fehleranfaellig (versehentliches Deselektieren)."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "copy": {
      "placeholder": {
        "maxChars": 40,
        "note": "Erste <option> als Placeholder (disabled, selected, value=''). Z.B. 'Bitte waehlen...'. Bei required+value='' greift :invalid fuer Placeholder-Farbe."
      }
    }
  },
  "styling": {
    "baseClasses": [
      "nc-select"
    ],
    "baseTokenGroups": [
      "core-indicator",
      "core-geometry",
      "core-colors"
    ],
    "tokenGroups": {
      "core-indicator": {
        "label": "Indicator",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-select-indicator-size",
          "nc-select-indicator-color"
        ]
      },
      "core-geometry": {
        "label": "Geometry",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-select-padding-right"
        ]
      },
      "core-colors": {
        "label": "Colors (Outlined)",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-form-control-bg",
          "nc-form-control-border-color",
          "nc-form-control-color"
        ]
      },
      "core-colors-filled": {
        "label": "Colors (Filled)",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-form-control-filled-bg",
          "nc-form-control-filled-border-bottom",
          "nc-form-control-filled-color"
        ]
      },
      "core-colors-minimal": {
        "label": "Colors (Borderless)",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-form-control-minimal-bg-hover",
          "nc-form-control-minimal-border-focus"
        ]
      },
      "optgroup-styling": {
        "label": "Optgroup",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-select-optgroup-font-weight",
          "nc-select-optgroup-padding-left"
        ]
      },
      "state-error": {
        "label": "Error",
        "tokens": []
      },
      "state-success": {
        "label": "Success",
        "tokens": []
      }
    }
  },
  "recipes": {
    "mode": "derived",
    "derive": {
      "from": [
        "axes",
        "states",
        "styling.tokenGroups"
      ],
      "output": [
        "classList",
        "resolvedTokens",
        "a11yAssertions"
      ]
    },
    "resolution": {
      "classList": [
        "styling.baseClasses",
        "axes.variant.values.*.modifier",
        "axes.size.values.*.modifier",
        "axes.type.values.*.modifier",
        "axes.content.values.*.modifier",
        "axes.validation.values.*.modifier"
      ],
      "tokenGroups": [
        "styling.baseTokenGroups",
        "axes.*.values.*.tokenGroups"
      ]
    }
  },
  "komposition": [
    {
      "art": "teilt",
      "recipe": "input",
      "tokenPraefix": "nc-input-",
      "hinweis": "Natives Select mit der Formular-Basis des Inputs (form-control-base); die geoeffnete Liste zeichnet der Browser (Entscheidung 01.10.2026)."
    }
  ],
  "keyboard": {
    "Space": {
      "action": "open",
      "note": "Oeffnet die native Liste (.is-open am Wrapper, Chevron dreht)."
    },
    "Enter": {
      "action": "open",
      "note": "Wie Space (sofern die Liste geschlossen ist)."
    },
    "Alt+ArrowDown": {
      "action": "open",
      "note": "Oeffnet die native Liste."
    },
    "F4": {
      "action": "open",
      "note": "Oeffnet die native Liste (Windows)."
    },
    "Escape": {
      "action": "close",
      "note": "Schliesst die Liste, .is-open entfaellt."
    },
    "Tab": {
      "action": "close",
      "note": "Fokus verlaesst das Feld, .is-open entfaellt."
    }
  },
  "events": {
    "change": {
      "bubbles": true,
      "note": "Natives change des <select> bei Auswahl. Das Behavior sendet keine eigenen Ereignisse."
    }
  },
  "specimens": [
    {
      "id": "all-states",
      "label": "All States — MD",
      "description": "Select in allen interaktiven Zustaenden",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": [
            "outlined"
          ],
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "type": [
            "single"
          ],
          "content": [
            "flat"
          ],
          "validation": [
            "none"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default",
          "hover",
          "focus",
          "disabled"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "label": "{state}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Alle States muessen visuell unterscheidbar sein. Focus braucht sichtbaren Ring. Arrow-Indicator muss in allen States erkennbar bleiben."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "variant-comparison",
      "label": "Variant Comparison",
      "description": "Outlined vs Filled vs Borderless — alle 3 Varianten im Vergleich",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": "*",
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "type": [
            "single"
          ],
          "content": [
            "flat"
          ],
          "validation": [
            "none"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default",
          "hover",
          "focus"
        ]
      },
      "focusTokenGroups": [
        "core-colors",
        "core-colors-filled",
        "core-colors-minimal"
      ],
      "layout": "grid",
      "layoutConfig": {
        "rowAxis": "variant"
      },
      "render": {
        "label": "{variant}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Borderless muss bei Hover/Focus eine sichtbare Abgrenzung zeigen. Filled-Unterstreichung braucht 3:1 Kontrast. Filled/Borderless verwenden Custom Indicator statt background-image."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "size-scale",
      "label": "Size Scale — SM / MD / LG",
      "description": "Alle 3 Groessen im Vergleich",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": [
            "outlined"
          ],
          "size": "*",
          "type": [
            "single"
          ],
          "content": [
            "flat"
          ],
          "validation": [
            "none"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "focusTokenGroups": [
        "core-indicator",
        "core-geometry"
      ],
      "layout": "grid",
      "layoutConfig": {
        "rowAxis": "size"
      },
      "render": {
        "label": "{size}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Arrow-Position passt sich an Groesse an. SM hat reduzierten padding-right."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "validation-states",
      "label": "Validation States",
      "description": "Error und Success im Vergleich zu Default",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": [
            "outlined"
          ],
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "type": [
            "single"
          ],
          "content": [
            "flat"
          ],
          "validation": "*"
        },
        "states": [
          "default",
          "focus"
        ]
      },
      "focusTokenGroups": [
        "state-error",
        "state-success"
      ],
      "layout": "grid",
      "layoutConfig": {
        "rowAxis": "validation"
      },
      "render": {
        "label": "{validation}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA non-text (3:1)",
        "note": "Error-/Success-Border muss 3:1 Kontrast haben. Farbe nie als einziges Signal."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "single-vs-multiple",
      "label": "Single vs Multiple",
      "description": "Standard-Dropdown vs native Mehrfachauswahl (nur Fallback)",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": [
            "outlined"
          ],
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "type": "*",
          "content": [
            "flat"
          ],
          "validation": [
            "none"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "label": "{type}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Multiple-Select hat keinen Arrow und auto-Height. Ctrl+Click fuer Mehrfachauswahl — schwer discoverable. Empfehlung: JS-basierte Combobox fuer produktive UIs."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "with-optgroups",
      "label": "With Optgroups",
      "description": "Select mit gruppierten Optionen (<optgroup>) — Fettdruck und Einrueckung",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": [
            "outlined"
          ],
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "type": [
            "single"
          ],
          "content": [
            "grouped"
          ],
          "validation": [
            "none"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "focusTokenGroups": [
        "optgroup-styling"
      ],
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "select-optgroups",
        "label": "optgroups"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Optgroups nutzen natives <optgroup label='...'>. Screenreader lesen den Label automatisch vor. Einrueckung verbessert visuelle Hierarchie."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "with-indicator",
      "label": "With Custom Indicator",
      "description": "Select im Wrapper mit custom SVG-Indicator statt background-image",
      "composes": [
        "indicator"
      ],
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": [
            "outlined"
          ],
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "type": [
            "single"
          ],
          "content": [
            "flat"
          ],
          "validation": [
            "none"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default",
          "focus"
        ]
      },
      "focusTokenGroups": [
        "core-indicator"
      ],
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "select-with-indicator",
        "label": "indicator"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Custom Indicator hat pointer-events: none — Klick geht durch zum Select. Indicator ist rein dekorativ."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "open-state",
      "label": "Open State (Chevron Rotation)",
      "description": "Wrapper mit .is-open Klasse — Chevron rotiert 180 Grad",
      "composes": [
        "indicator"
      ],
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": [
            "outlined"
          ],
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "type": [
            "single"
          ],
          "content": [
            "flat"
          ],
          "validation": [
            "none"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "select-open-state",
        "label": "open-state"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Chevron-Rotation ist rein visuelles Feedback. Kein ARIA-Attribut noetig — natives Select kommuniziert Open/Closed selbst."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "placeholder-hack",
      "label": "Placeholder Color",
      "description": "Select mit Placeholder-Farbe via :required:invalid Hack",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": [
            "outlined"
          ],
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "type": [
            "single"
          ],
          "content": [
            "flat"
          ],
          "validation": [
            "none"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "select-placeholder",
        "label": "placeholder"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Placeholder-Option: <option disabled selected value=''>Bitte waehlen...</option>. Placeholder-Farbe via :required:invalid muss 4.5:1 Kontrast haben."
      }
    }
  ]
}
